              Maria Vasileiou on behalf of the ALICE Collaboration,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Measurement of the Hadronic Resonance Production with ALICE at the CERN LHC
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.3390/universe5010006"} doi:10.3390/universe5010006
          %h3#in_lattice_qcd In lattice QCD
          %p
            Computation of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/mass"} mass
            of hadrons using
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/lattice+QCD"} lattice QCD
            (see also
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/confinement"} confinement
            and
            = succeed ")" do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/mass+gap+problem"} mass gap problem
          %ul
            %li
              %p S. Durr, Z. Fodor, J. Frison, C. Hoelbling, R. Hoffmann, S.D. Katz, S. Krieg, T. Kurth, L. Lellouch, T. Lippert, K.K. Szabo, G. Vulvert,
              %p
                %em> Ab-initio Determination of Light Hadron Masses
                ,
              %p
                Science 322:1224-1227,2008 (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/0906.3599"}> arXiv:0906.3599
                )
              %p conclusion on p. 4:
          %blockquote
            %p
              our study strongly suggests that
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/QCD"} QCD
              is the theory of the strong interaction, at low energies as well
          %ul
            %li#FodorHoelbling12
              %p
                Zoltan Fodor, Christian Hoelbling,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Light Hadron Masses from Lattice QCD
                = succeed ")" do
